      "with": ["ingredient/chicken-stock", "ingredient/tarragon"],
      "text": "Add the stock and the stalks of the tarragon, and keep the leaves. Put the chicken back, skin side up, cover and simmer gently, taking the breast pieces out before the legs. Check the thickest part against a trusted guide to doneness.",
      "time": {"from": 20, "to": 25, "unit": "minute"},
      "temperature": null,
